rt>ざか</rt></ruby>46で<ruby>表紙<rt>ひょうし</rt></ruby>を<ruby>務<rt>つと</rt></ruby>めさせていただき、<ruby>感謝<rt>かんしゃ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>気持<rt>きも</rt></ruby>ちでいっぱいです！</span></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Overpass, Noto Sans JP, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, Segoe UI, ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3, Meiryo, sans-serif\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>にありがとうございます！</span></font></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;ヒラギノ角ゴ ProN W3&quot;, Meiryo, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div>　</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kamimura.hinano/2020-12-30/37249_3.jpg\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br style=\"word-break: break-all; box-sizing: border-box; caret-color: rgb(99, 103, 103); color: rgb(99, 103, 103); font-family: Overpass, &quot;Noto Sans JP&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSyst